\paragraph{Limitations and scope.}
We study OpenVLA-7B on LIBERO; generalization to other VLAs and backbones remains open.
Per-layer profiles are metric-dependent (RSA vs.\ CKA; Appendix~\ref{sec:cka_appendix}); $R^2$ provides metric-independent evidence; analyses are post-hoc (Appendix~\ref{sec:metric_sensitivity_appendix}).

